AArch64 encoding definitions
============================

`definitions/aarch64/0.1.0.json`, `0.2.0.json`, `0.3.0.json` and `0.4.0.json` are
derived from the Arm Architecture Machine Readable Specification, A-profile,
2026-06 (release `2026-06_rel`, build 818, schema 2.9.5). All four are generated
from the same pinned drop and ship under the same terms; each later document
repeats the earlier rows and adds its own, so there is one notice for all of
them.

